      "start": "00:04:17.033",
      "text": " Unusual."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:21.033",
      "start": "00:04:19.033",
      "text": " We had to point, Polleners, what else?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:25.033",
      "start": "00:04:21.033",
      "text": " Oh, what was the other thing?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:27.033",
      "start": "00:04:25.033",
      "text": " Um..."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:29.033",
      "start": "00:04:27.033",
      "text": " Fick Noginor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:31.033",
      "start": "00:04:29.033",
      "text": " Or pick Noginor."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:33.033",
      "start": "00:04:31.033",
      "text": " Got heaps of energy."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:41.033",
      "start": "00:04:39.033",
      "text": " What does that mean?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:43.033",
      "start": "00:04:41.033",
      "text": " I'm going the wrong way."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:49.033",
      "start": "00:04:47.033",
      "text": " What does it mean?"
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:53.033",
      "start": "00:04:51.033",
      "text": " It's ending working."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:57.033",
      "start": "00:04:55.033",
      "text": " There we go."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:04:59.033",
      "start": "00:04:57.033",
      "text": " Destination."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:21.033",
      "start": "00:05:17.033",
      "text": " I thought I'd keep on going as a good rest spot."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:23.033",
      "start": "00:05:21.033",
      "text": " I'm going to go back."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:27.033",
      "start": "00:05:23.033",
      "text": " Maybe in this section, Davies Trial goes down to the primatorium."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:31.033",
      "start": "00:05:27.033",
      "text": " I'll get a marker to see if I'll go in."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:35.033",
      "start": "00:05:33.033",
      "text": " Swap out of my backpack."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:39.033",
      "start": "00:05:35.033",
      "text": " Change it over and get me a fleece out."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:43.033",
      "start": "00:05:39.033",
      "text": " If it walks back, it's getting a bit cool."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:49.033",
      "start": "00:05:47.033",
      "text": " That's the packer being carried."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:53.033",
      "start": "00:05:51.033",
      "text": " It's got room for another three litres of water in it."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:55.033",
      "start": "00:05:53.033",
      "text": " Didn't bother though."
    },
    {
      "end": "00:05:57.033",
